tinker_cookbook.distillation.train_on_policy:201 [INFO] <|im_system|>system<|im_middle|>You are Kimi, an AI assistant created by Moonshot AI.<|im_end|><|im_user|>user<|im_middle|>Write a short poem about autumn leaves.<|im_end|><|im_assistant|>assistant<|im_middle|><think></think>Autumn leaves paint the evening in slow fire—
Amber tongues whispering light
Across slender branches that sway
As if remembering spring.

They spiral like letters
From a dying correspondence,
The shut mouth of an unopened letter
Still sealed with honey and smoke.

Do not call it sorrow
When a bright thing finds another way
To hold the sun—
These goldened coins,
This brief, brave currency
